abstract: >-
  Tidyverse-friendly R and pandas-friendly Python interfaces to the MI Social
  API (Matriz de Informação Social) of the Brazilian Ministry of Development
  and Social Assistance (MDS/SAGI). Monthly municipal series of the Cadastro
  Único, the Bolsa Família programme and its conditionalities, the BPC
  benefit, the social assistance network (SUAS) and its funding, and food
  security programmes, as tidy long-format tibbles and DataFrames.
